{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-03-09 06:30:00', 'title': "TRIMBLE'S TEKLA 2022 SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS ENABLE MORE SUSTAINABLE CONSTRUCTION", 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., MARCH 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE INTRODUCTION OF THE LATEST VERSIONS OF ITS TEKLA® SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS FOR CONSTRUCTIBLE BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING (BIM), STRUCTURAL ENGINEERING AND STEEL FABRICATION MANAGEMENT: TEKLA STRUCTURES 2022, TEKLA STRUCTURAL DESIGNER 2022, TEKLA TEDDS 2022 AND TEKLA POWERFAB 2022.'}